DESCRIPTION:Full rest only — no walking or jogging. Today is 5 km open-wa
 ter race recovery\; keep feet up\, prioritise nutrition\, hydration\, and 
 sleep.\n\nReason: After a 5 km open-water race on already chronically low 
 sleep and depleted body battery\, even 25 minutes of movement is unnecessa
 ry stress — complete rest accelerates recovery ahead of the 10K in 6 day
 s.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-03
