DESCRIPTION:Skip the pool swim — single training session day only (the sh
 ortened run)\; legs and shoulders need to consolidate recovery from today'
 s open-water race.\n\nReason: Doubling up run intervals and a 2 km swim se
 ssion just 3 days post-race and 4 days pre-race overloads recovery\; swimm
 ing adds little 10K-specific benefit and risks carry-over fatigue into rac
 e day.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-03
