DESCRIPTION:Skip the evening cycling spin entirely — strength session onl
 y (shortened to 30 min\, bodyweight/low-load core and single-leg work only
 ).\n\nReason: Two days before the 10K\, any additional endurance load on t
 op of strength work increases pre-race fatigue without meaningful fitness 
 gain at this stage of the taper.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-03
END:VEVENT
