SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Add a 30 min easy recovery run at 7:00–
 7:30/km on Tuesday Oc
DESCRIPTION:Add a 30 min easy recovery run at 7:00–7:30/km on Tuesday Oct
 ober 13 in place of or before the evening cycling spin — this reintroduc
 es gentle run stimulus after the race.\n\nReason: After the 10K race there
  is no run until Thursday's intervals in week 17\; a short Tuesday easy ru
 n bridges the gap and prevents the legs going stale before the interval se
 ssion.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-03
END:VEVENT
